<title>USA: Krystal to emerge from Chap 11 by end Q1.</title>
<headline>Krystal to emerge from Chap 11 by end Q1.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Krystal Co said Monday that it expects to emerge from bankruptcy before the end of the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said it has been a debtor-in-possession since its Chapter 11 petition was filed December 15.</p>
</text>
